For reference, we are trying to mimic what [HlmsBufferManager::mapNextConstBuffer](https://github.com/OGRECave/ogre-next/blob/e2287964648740c705da60fd983b068eb4f4f827/Components/Hlms/Common/src/OgreHlmsBufferManager.cpp#L115) does and see whatever mapNextConstBuffer is doing to know when we (gazebo) have to also create a new ConstBuffer to bind it.

So if `this->lastMainConstBuffer != _constBuffers[_currConstBufferIdx]` is true that means `mConstBuffers[mCurrentConstBuffer]` has changed (which are both variables controlled by `HlmsBufferManager`) and therefore gazebo should do the same.

I believe this should be the correct code:

